{"name":"Pussyfoot","hex":"#cebada","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pussyfoot","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To move silently, stealthily, or furtively.","To act timidly or cautiously."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A teetotaller.","Synonym of bluemink (“Ageratum houstonianum”)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pussyfoot"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pussyfoot","blocks":[{"text":"Pussyfoot was a British recording act of the late 1970s. The act consisted of songwriter, producer and musician Mick Flinn, and vocalist Donna Jones. Flinn remained behind the scenes, and Jones was marketed as a solo artist."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pussyfoot"},{"title":"Pussyfoot (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Pussyfoot is a 2008 comedy film directed by Dusan Sekulovic."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e0/Pussyfoot_film.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pussyfoot_(film)"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"pussyfoot":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/En-au-pussyfoot.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bf/En-au-pussyfoot.ogg/En-au-pussyfoot.ogg.mp3"}]}}}